WEBVTT

00:00:01.700 --> 00:00:03.220
Stop it...

00:00:03.480 --> 00:00:05.280
S-Stay back...

00:00:05.280 --> 00:00:07.230
Stay back!

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:23.870
Dad...

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:27.830
Smiles, Yuya.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:12.720
In a world split into four dimensions,

00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:16.390
four boys exist, all with the same face.

00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:20.290
Their dragons call to each other,

00:01:20.800 --> 00:01:23.520
almost as if seeking one another.

00:02:57.190 --> 00:03:01.960
The Allure of Darkness

00:03:06.260 --> 00:03:07.900
That is nice!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:13.370
I like this expression of yours much better.

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.340
Give him back!

00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:19.310
No! Do not let the darkness take you!

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:22.680
Brother!

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:27.930
So nice!

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:34.230
This anger and power... If I become one 
with you, it will all be mine, right?

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:37.840
You'll... pay...

00:03:37.840 --> 00:03:40.200
For turning my father into a card...

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:43.640
Wait! Do not get any closer to Joeri!

00:03:44.880 --> 00:03:47.140
You will pay...

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:50.300
You want this card, right?

00:03:50.930 --> 00:03:53.610
Then you had better fight me...

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:55.900
In a duel, of course!

00:03:57.130 --> 00:03:59.780
Yeah! You're on!

00:04:01.970 --> 00:04:04.660
Field Spell Crossover.

00:04:06.760 --> 00:04:07.960
Duel!

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:11.880
Your father worked so hard.

00:04:11.880 --> 00:04:13.920
I hope you give me some fun, too.

00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:15.550
I will go first.

00:04:15.550 --> 00:04:20.140
I summon Predaplant Ophrys 
Scorpio from my hand.

00:04:24.640 --> 00:04:27.480
When Ophrys Scorpio is summoned,

00:04:27.480 --> 00:04:31.000
I can send one Predaplant from 
my hand to my graveyard,

00:04:31.000 --> 00:04:35.560
to Special Summon a Predaplant, 
of Level 3 or below, from my deck.

00:04:35.560 --> 00:04:40.360
I send Predaplant Stapeliaworm 
from my hand to my graveyard,

00:04:40.760 --> 00:04:45.660
to Special Summon Predaplant 
Darlingtonia Cobra from my deck.

00:04:48.560 --> 00:04:51.840
When Darlingtonia Cobra is Special Summoned,

00:04:51.840 --> 00:04:55.880
I can add spell card Polymerization 
from my deck to my hand.

00:04:57.380 --> 00:05:01.000
Let me bring out the monster 
that defeated your father.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:05.020
I activate spell card Polymerization!

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:09.590
I fuse Ophrys Scorpion and Darlingtonia 
Cobra on my side of the field.

00:05:09.990 --> 00:05:14.330
Two beautiful flowers, which use alluring 
fragrance to attract insects.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:20.470
Now become one, and from the hell 
of your petals, birth a new terror.

00:05:20.970 --> 00:05:22.670
Fusion Summon!

00:05:22.670 --> 00:05:26.240
Appear, poisonous dragon with hungry fangs,

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:30.140
Level 8 Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:05:35.400 --> 00:05:39.280
My Starving Venom desires a friend.

00:05:39.280 --> 00:05:42.770
Yes, your dragon.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:46.490
I set one card and end my turn.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:55.570
My turn!

00:06:01.490 --> 00:06:03.640
Smiles, Yuya.

00:06:15.110 --> 00:06:18.960
What's wrong? I thought you 
were going to make me pay.

00:06:18.960 --> 00:06:22.090
Or was that all talk?

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:24.660
Then, go ahead and surrender already.

00:06:25.120 --> 00:06:29.620
Either way, you cannot beat me, so just 
concede and get it over with.

00:06:54.980 --> 00:06:57.090
Laugh when you want to cry.

00:06:57.090 --> 00:06:59.230
Laugh with all your might.

00:07:00.070 --> 00:07:01.200
Dad...

00:07:02.070 --> 00:07:05.400
If you get scared and cringe, 
you can't do anything.

00:07:05.890 --> 00:07:09.210
If you want to win, then have 
courage and step forward.

00:07:12.020 --> 00:07:16.090
That courage will return as happiness.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:20.260
I won't be afraid.

00:07:20.760 --> 00:07:24.060
I set the Pendulum Scale with 
Scale 1 Stargazer Magician

00:07:24.060 --> 00:07:28.570
and Scale 8 Timegazer Magician!

00:07:36.040 --> 00:07:39.900
Now I can summon monsters between 
Levels 2 and 7 simultaneously!

00:07:40.410 --> 00:07:42.870
Swing, my soul's pendulum!

00:07:43.440 --> 00:07:45.840
Draw an arc of light in the sky!

00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:47.790
Pendulum Summon!

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:49.380
Come out!

00:07:52.110 --> 00:07:55.550
Level 4 Performapal Coin Dragon!

00:07:55.750 --> 00:08:00.360
And the heroic one with beautiful 
different-colored eyes,

00:08:00.360 --> 00:08:02.790
Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:08:05.570 --> 00:08:07.030
Two already?

00:08:07.960 --> 00:08:11.000
Our hearts are in tune, I see.

00:08:16.170 --> 00:08:18.280
Here it comes!

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:25.670
Yuya...

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:29.990
Is he being drawn in by the 
dragons' resonating power?

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:40.800
Yuya is resisting.

00:08:40.800 --> 00:08:42.280
But, Brother...

00:08:42.980 --> 00:08:44.170
Ray is saying,

00:08:44.900 --> 00:08:48.140
"There's no avoiding Z-ARC's rebirth now."

00:08:48.480 --> 00:08:50.730
Yet he is trying so hard to avoid it...

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:54.110
Yuya is fighting for our sake.

00:08:56.530 --> 00:08:58.780
Why do you fight so hard?

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:02.290
Be honest about your feelings.

00:09:03.400 --> 00:09:05.260
Coin Dragon's effect.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:10.460
I raise the attack points, by 500, 
of Dragon-Type Monsters on my field.

00:09:17.670 --> 00:09:18.670
Battle!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:21.920
Odd-Eyes, attack Starving Venom!

00:09:21.920 --> 00:09:25.160
Spiral Strike Burst!

00:09:25.880 --> 00:09:29.040
I told you that fighting will not help you.

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:32.350
I activate my trap Predaprouting!

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:36.050
When a Dark Attribute Monster is attacked,

00:09:36.050 --> 00:09:41.530
I negate destruction by battle and 
destroy the attacking monster.

00:09:43.080 --> 00:09:45.230
Coin Dragon's other effect!

00:09:45.640 --> 00:09:47.930
Odd-Eyes isn't destroyed, either!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:53.290
And when Odd-Eyes does battle with 
a monster, of Level 5 or above,

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.440
battle damage is doubled!

00:09:55.440 --> 00:09:57.240
Reaction Force!

00:10:01.110 --> 00:10:04.420
Is that the most your dragon can do?

00:10:04.890 --> 00:10:06.510
Thank you.

00:10:06.510 --> 00:10:09.620
You are making it easy for me to proceed.

00:10:09.920 --> 00:10:16.790
Predaprouting's effect lets me Special 
Summon three Predaplant Tokens.

00:10:20.870 --> 00:10:25.010
But as long as Dad's watching 
over me, I won't lose.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:28.710
Coin Dragon attacks Predaplant Token!

00:10:31.640 --> 00:10:36.730
I did destroy one of the three 
Tokens he summoned...

00:10:36.730 --> 00:10:39.270
But he still has two remaining.

00:10:39.270 --> 00:10:43.880
On his next turn, he surely means 
to do something with them.

00:10:43.880 --> 00:10:44.620
Yeah.

00:10:44.920 --> 00:10:46.320
But we'll deal with whatever it is.

00:10:46.950 --> 00:10:48.980
We'll strike back with this card.

00:10:49.850 --> 00:10:54.000
Yeah. We'll seal Z-ARC ourselves.

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:57.770
I set one card and end my turn.

00:10:59.740 --> 00:11:01.550
Such desperation.

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.440
I wonder how long it will last.

00:11:03.440 --> 00:11:05.410
My turn!

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:09.380
I tribute one Predaplant Token

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:15.350
to Tribute Summon Tuner Monster 
Predaplant Banksiogre.

00:11:15.710 --> 00:11:16.820
Tuner?

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:21.890
Let me show how pointless your struggles are.

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:29.050
Level 6 Predaplant Banksiogre tunes 
Level 1 Predaplant Token.

00:11:30.160 --> 00:11:33.610
Flap your beautiful and heroic wings,

00:11:33.610 --> 00:11:35.930
to strike the enemy at the speed of light!

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.680
Synchro Summon!

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:44.170
Appear, Level 7 Clear Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:11:50.130 --> 00:11:52.920
What? Three dragons on the field?

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:00.660
It's here! It's here!

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.530
Amazing... This is amazing!

00:12:11.320 --> 00:12:13.990
Are you okay, Ute? Hang in there!

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:18.750
Dad... Watch over me.

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:23.240
I will never... become a devil...

00:12:25.760 --> 00:12:28.420
I told you, struggling is pointless.

00:12:29.780 --> 00:12:32.460
You should be honest with yourself.

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:35.930
If Clear Wing is out,

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:38.540
he's going to use the combo 
he used on Yuya's father!

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:44.000
Your pointless struggles are giving 
you the best expressions.

00:12:44.000 --> 00:12:46.140
What about this, then?

00:12:46.820 --> 00:12:50.620
I activate Starving Venom Fusion Dragon's effect.

00:12:51.000 --> 00:12:56.820
It negates the effect of a monster, of Level 
5 or above, and takes it for itself.

00:12:56.820 --> 00:13:00.790
I choose Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon to—

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:01.830
It's what you're doing

00:13:02.240 --> 00:13:03.300
that's pointless.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:08.000
I activate my Continuous Trap Starlight Force!

00:13:09.230 --> 00:13:14.760
The effects of monsters Special Summoned 
from the Extra Deck are negated!

00:13:14.760 --> 00:13:15.670
What?

00:13:16.010 --> 00:13:20.120
I won't let you use Starving Venom's effect.

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:24.150
And all of your monsters become Level 4!

00:13:27.020 --> 00:13:29.120
He blocked that awful combo!

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.090
Good.

00:13:30.090 --> 00:13:32.080
Not bad at all.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.500
Battle, then!

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:38.200
I attack Coin Dragon with Clear 
Wing Synchro Dragon!

00:13:46.980 --> 00:13:50.040
The attack points Coin Dragon was increasing...

00:13:50.040 --> 00:13:53.680
And I attack Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon

00:13:53.680 --> 00:13:56.540
with Starving Venom Fusion Dragon!

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.600
But I'll still get a chance...

00:14:07.830 --> 00:14:10.120
You have lost everything.

00:14:10.120 --> 00:14:11.950
Now, what will you do?

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:16.150
I set one card and end my turn.

00:14:18.610 --> 00:14:22.840
I will... I will win...

00:14:23.480 --> 00:14:26.040
Watch me, Dad.

00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.490
If this duel ends,

00:14:37.240 --> 00:14:40.280
Z-ARC's resurrection will be complete.

00:14:40.280 --> 00:14:41.460
How is the last one coming?

00:14:42.230 --> 00:14:45.060
Can't you send in Serena yet?

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.870
Until ARC-V's life energy

00:14:47.870 --> 00:14:50.970
reaches appropriate levels for the fourth, we need—

00:14:50.970 --> 00:14:54.240
Just hurry. We don't have a moment to lose.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:55.130
Yes, sir!

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:01.500
It's okay.

00:15:02.120 --> 00:15:05.380
The chance I created still exists.

00:15:06.240 --> 00:15:10.760
Starlight Force is still negating 
his monsters' effects.

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:14.040
And at the next Standby Phase,

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:16.960
Starlight Force's other effect

00:15:16.960 --> 00:15:20.630
will increase Clear Wing's and 
Starving Venom's levels by one.

00:15:21.120 --> 00:15:23.540
Then, if I summon it...

00:15:24.150 --> 00:15:25.370
Dark Rebellion?

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:30.110
It's true that if you use Dark Rebellion's effect,

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.840
with his two monsters' effects gone, 
you can take control of the fight.

00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:40.050
And I have Odd-Eyes and Level 4 
Coin Dragon in my Extra Deck.

00:15:40.400 --> 00:15:43.800
A Level 4 monster. If I can draw one...

00:15:44.230 --> 00:15:47.450
Pendulum Summon, combine with Coin Dragon,

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:48.760
and call out Dark Rebellion.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:53.130
Last turn, we had three dragons 
out, and we bore it.

00:15:54.080 --> 00:15:56.600
Even with Dark Rebellion, there will only be three.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:58.810
My turn!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:03.840
Level 5! But with this card...

00:16:04.640 --> 00:16:05.880
In that instant,

00:16:05.880 --> 00:16:10.820
the levels of the monsters Starlight 
Force affected increase by one!

00:16:14.440 --> 00:16:17.350
But their monster effects remain negated.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.690
I won't let your dragons stop me!

00:16:20.470 --> 00:16:24.070
But to use it to call out Dark Rebellion...

00:16:24.920 --> 00:16:26.830
Why hesitate, Yuya?

00:16:26.830 --> 00:16:28.270
Call out Odd-Eyes!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:35.240
Then you can use Drop Gallop's 
effect to set its level to 4.

00:16:35.490 --> 00:16:37.690
I know that, Ute.

00:16:37.690 --> 00:16:41.350
But things were close when 
three dragons were out.

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:43.360
If there are four...

00:16:43.360 --> 00:16:47.300
If we have all four dragons out, I know 
we'll be taken by that darkness.

00:16:47.780 --> 00:16:51.460
Even if I am, you can withstand it.

00:16:52.020 --> 00:16:55.480
That card will protect you. I'm sure of it.

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:58.790
So even if I'm taken by darkness,

00:16:59.270 --> 00:17:01.530
you'll pull me out of it.

00:17:02.880 --> 00:17:04.250
I know you can do it.

00:17:04.690 --> 00:17:06.240
I believe in you.

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.040
Ute...

00:17:10.470 --> 00:17:13.960
I will endure it. And win!

00:17:14.960 --> 00:17:20.180
I use the Pendulum Scale already 
set with Scale 1 and Scale 8

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.340
to Pendulum Summon!

00:17:22.340 --> 00:17:24.690
Be reborn from my Extra Deck...

00:17:25.000 --> 00:17:28.380
Level 7 Odd-Eyes Pendulum Dragon!

00:17:31.100 --> 00:17:34.470
Level 4 Performapal Coin Dragon!

00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:39.200
And from my hand, Level 5 
Performapal Drop Gallop!

00:17:47.180 --> 00:17:50.010
It's here, it's here, it's here!

00:17:51.190 --> 00:17:54.330
Drop Gallop lets me draw 
as many cards as I have

00:17:54.330 --> 00:17:57.420
Pendulum Summoned Performapals on the field!

00:17:58.710 --> 00:18:03.330
And when a monster, of Level 5 or 
above, is on my side of the field,

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:06.880
I can set Drop Gallop's level to anything from 1 to 5!

00:18:06.880 --> 00:18:09.030
I set Drop Gallop to Level 4!

00:18:09.860 --> 00:18:16.440
Then I overlay Level 4 Drop 
Gallop and Coin Dragon!

00:18:19.400 --> 00:18:20.910
From the black darkness,

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:26.820
the fangs of rebellion that fight against 
the powers of stupidity descend!

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:29.020
Xyz Summon!

00:18:29.850 --> 00:18:35.490
Appear, Rank 4 Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:18:54.360 --> 00:18:55.200
Ute!

00:18:55.200 --> 00:18:57.450
Don't worry about me! Hurry!

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.280
It's here! It's here!

00:18:59.550 --> 00:19:03.250
Amazing! Amazing! It's too amazing!

00:19:03.620 --> 00:19:05.720
This is incredible!

00:19:09.360 --> 00:19:10.600
I'll end it with this.

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:13.480
I will end it with this!

00:19:13.480 --> 00:19:16.890
I will not become a devil!

00:19:28.510 --> 00:19:32.220
It's all over! Yuya's losing himself!

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:40.060
No, Yuya is still fighting as hard as he can.

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:44.030
For our sake... And for the world!

00:20:07.000 --> 00:20:07.790
I endured it.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:13.540
I have not become a devil.

00:20:15.270 --> 00:20:16.380
Dad...

00:20:19.810 --> 00:20:21.200
Let's go, Ute.

00:20:21.670 --> 00:20:25.220
I activate Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon's effect!

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.830
Just kidding!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:35.610
I would not be finished that easily!

00:20:35.980 --> 00:20:39.080
I activate my Continuous Trap Dragonvine!

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:43.120
When a Dragon-Type Monster 
is on my side of the field,

00:20:43.120 --> 00:20:46.700
I can take control of a Dragon-Type 
Monster on your side of the field,

00:20:46.700 --> 00:20:49.830
as long as its level is not higher.

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:50.830
What?

00:20:50.830 --> 00:20:55.550
I am taking your Dark Rebellion Xyz Dragon!

00:21:07.380 --> 00:21:10.900
No one can stop us now.

00:21:11.800 --> 00:21:14.250
Now...

00:21:16.250 --> 00:21:18.460
Now we'll become one!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:22.390
Now we'll become one.

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:26.330
Now we'll become one.

00:21:26.710 --> 00:21:28.700
Ute! You, too?

00:21:31.700 --> 00:21:33.720
Stop it!

00:21:33.720 --> 00:21:35.740
Yuya! Yuya!

00:21:40.920 --> 00:21:42.870
Sending Serena in!

00:21:55.630 --> 00:21:58.130
ARC-V has activated!

00:21:58.130 --> 00:22:01.450
Now, the fusion of dimensions will begin.

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:03.570
All that remains...

00:23:49.060 --> 00:23:52.250
Even your last hope, Dark Rebellion, 
has come to me.

00:23:52.250 --> 00:23:54.940
I see there is nothing you can do now.

00:23:54.940 --> 00:23:56.460
Just surrender!

00:23:56.460 --> 00:23:57.450
Never.

00:23:57.450 --> 00:23:59.560
I... I will never...

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:02.810
Now, say it... Say, "I lose."

00:24:02.810 --> 00:24:05.390
Say, "Let's become one!"

00:24:05.390 --> 00:24:06.960
Now become one.

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:08.540
Now become one.

00:24:08.540 --> 00:24:11.060
Now... become one!

00:24:11.800 --> 00:24:15.340
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
The Trembling Dimensions.

00:24:15.340 --> 00:24:17.270
The fun is only getting started!
